# M-sweep2 — FINAL full-corpus differential rig log (lane/sweep2)

Acceptance evidence sweep for tagging **v2.0.24.beta.12**, run post-M-retire
(opentui is the only renderer). Full corpus, FULL live (`--no-ref-cache`),
both sizes × `--runs 2`, one script per invocation, against the pinned
v2.0.24 reference. Baseline: the FIRST final sweep at
`/tmp/opencode/final-sweep/` (report.md + per-step data).

Worktree: `/opt/opencode-rust/.worktrees/lane-sweep2` (branch `lane/sweep2`,
base a7a71b1). Artifacts: `/tmp/opencode/final-sweep-2/` (per-script report
snapshots under `reports/`). Stale-binary rule honored: `target/debug/
opencode-rust` + `target/debug/oc-server` are removed before every rig
invocation (rig rebuilds them).

Registered mismatch classes (adjudication whitelist):
- **(b)-coin** — per-run random: stats-row digits, `Thought Nms` suffix,
  farewell session-id chars, home-placeholder rotation, per-run random text
  lengths (structural mode).
- **style: backdrop-fg idx15** — pre-existing style family.
- **style: input-caret cell** — pre-existing style family.
- **style: mini-footer idx216↔232/233** — pre-existing family (future
  mini-footer lane, registered).
- **markdown list-marker/inline-concealment** — new, upstream-faithful,
  goldened in M-retire.

Acceptance bar: every script identical-or-better vs sweep 1; every mismatch
step decomposes into the classes above; any NEW divergence class = STOP.

